{"id": "3326729", "name": "נפח מעל תחום בין פרבולה לישר ומתחת למשטח", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">נפח מעל תחום בין פרבולה לישר</div><p>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle D\\)</span> התחום ברביע הראשון החסום על ידי</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle y=x^2,\\qquad y={{CT:0}}x \\]</p><p>חשבו את נפח הגוף הנמצא מעל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle D\\)</span> ומתחת למשטח</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle z={{CT:1}} \\]</p><p>כתבו תחילה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle V=\\int_a^b\\int_{c(x)}^{d(x)}{{CT:1}}\\,dy\\,dx  \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>הגבולות</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle a=\\) [[input:ans1]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle b=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"height:8px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle c(x)=\\) [[input:ans3]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle d(x)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>הנפח</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle V=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מוצאים את נקודות החיתוך של הפרבולה והישר, מתארים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span> באי-שוויונות, ומחשבים את האינטגרל החוזר מבפנים החוצה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — תיאור התחום (סעיף א׳)</b><br>נקודות החיתוך מתקבלות מן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x^2={{CT:2}}\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x=0,{{CT:0}}\\)</span>. בין שתי הנקודות הישר נמצא מעל הפרבולה (למשל ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x={{CT:3}}\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}} &lt; {{CT:5}}\\)</span>), ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle 0\\le x\\le{{CT:0}},\\qquad x^2\\le y\\le{{CT:2}} \\]</p>כלומר<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a={{CT:6}},\\qquad b={{CT:7}},\\qquad c(x)={{CT:8}},\\qquad d(x)={{CT:2}} \\]</p>המשטח נמצא מעל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span> (בתחום מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z>0\\)</span>), ולכן הנפח הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\iint_D z\\,dA\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — האינטגרל הפנימי</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_{x^2}^{{{CT:2}}}\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)dy={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — הנפח (סעיף ב׳)</b><br>מכאן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle V=\\int_0^{{{CT:0}}}\\int_{x^2}^{{{CT:2}}}{{CT:1}}\\,dy\\,dx={{CT:10}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct:if is(equal(ans1,xmin)) and is(equal(ans2,xmax)) and is(equal(ans3,ymin)) and is(equal(ans4,ymax)) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correct", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "vol", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["H", "J1", "fam", "p", "u", "vol", "xmax", "xmin", "ymax", "ymin", "zfun"], "nvariants": 27}